# The Crisp Edges
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
You always leave the darkest piece of bread for yourself.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
I thought you liked the soft middle.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
I like the crisp edges. You never asked.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Then we have eight years of breakfasts to correct.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Start with this one.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
She breaks the toast in two and gives you the larger half.
